 34S  c  1974Gr15: {+34}S(|a,|a') with 16.0, 16.5, 17.0, 17.5, and 18.0-MeV 34S 
 34S 2c  beams from the McMaster University FN tandem accelerator. Targets were 
 34S 3c  natural and {+34}S-enriched CdS evaporated on C backings. Scattered |a 
 34S 4c  particles were detected using an annular Si surface-barrier detector at
 34S 5c  176.8-178.7|'. Measured E{-|a}, I{-|a}. Primary measurements were      
 34S 6c  31P(p,|g) and 32S(|a,|a'). 1979DaZV is superseded by 1980Ba40.         
 34S  c  1980Ba40: {+4}He({+34}S,|a) with a 70-MeV 34S beam at Chalk River      
 34S 2c  Nuclear Laboratories. The targets were 25-|mm Cu foils implanted with  
 34S 3c  6|*10{+17} atoms/cm{+2} of 4He. Inelastically scattered |a particles   
 34S 4c  were detected using a |DE-E telescope of surface-barrier detectors at  
 34S 5c  0|' and |g rays were detected using a 100-cm3 Ge(Li) detector at 0|'.  
 34S 6c  Measured |a|g-coin. Deduced lifetime using DSAM lineshape analsyis and 
 34S 7c  B(E2)|^ for the first 2+ state in 34S. Also measured 208PB(28Si,28Si'),
 34S 8c  208PB(32S,32S'), and 208PB(34S,34S') for B(E2)|^ and quadrupole        
 34S 9c  moments.                                                               
 34S  c  1984Sa11: {+34}S(|a,|a),(|a,|a') with a 120-MeV |a beam from the       
 34S 2c  Indiana University Cyclotron Facility. The target was 94.3%-enriched   
 34S 3c  {+34}S on a {+12}C backing. Scattered |a particles were detected using 
 34S 4c  two scintillators at the focal plane of a                              
 34S 5c  quadrupole-dipole-dipole-multipole spectrometer. Measured |s(E{-|a},|q)
 34S 6c  for g.s. and first two 2+ states. Deduced the neutron and proton       
 34S 7c  transition matrix elements from DWBA and CHUCK3-CCBA analyses of the   
 34S 8c  measured |s(|q).                                                       
 34S  c  Others: 1994Br19 ({+34}S(|a,|a) E=20 MeV, |s(|q)). 1979Za01            
 34S 2c  ({+34}S(|a,|a'|g) E=8.90 MeV, measured g-factor for first 2+). 1973An24
 34S 3c  ({+34}S(|a,|a),(|a,|a') E=24.2 MeV).                                   
